          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰቀልክምዎ ፡ ወቀተልክምዎ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰቅላችሁ ፡ ገደላችሁት ፤ ም ፡ ፬ ፥ ፳፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": "፳፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፬ ፤ ወእግዚአብሔር ፡ አንሥኦ ፡ እምውታን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈቲሖ ፡ ማዕሠሪሁ ፡ ለሞት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔር ፡ ግን ፡ የሞት ፡ ቍራኝ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነትን፡አጥፍቶ፡ከሙታን፡ለይቶ፡አስነሣው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኢይክል ፡ አኂዞቶ ፡ ሞት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሞት ፡ ሊይዘው ፡ ሊገታው ፡ አይቻለውም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ና ፤ ም ፡ ፫ ፥ ፲፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፳፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፭ ፤ ወዳዊትኒ ፡ ይቤ ፡ በእንቲአሁ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሞት ፡ ቍራኝነትን ፡ አጥፍቶ ፡ እንዳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስነሣው ፡ ሞት ፡ ሊገታው፡ እንዳይቻለው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲያስረዳ ፡ ዳዊት ፡ የሱን ፡ ተናገረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘልፈ ፡ እሬእዮ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ቅድሜየ፡ ውእቱ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኵሉ ፡ ጊዜ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔር ፡ አብ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወልድን ፡ ሁልጊዜ ፡ በፊቴ ፡ አየዋለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ በህልውናየ ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": "፳፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፮ ፤ እስመ፡ በየማንየ፡ ውእቱ፡ ከመ፡ ኢይትሀወክ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዳይለይ ፡ በቀኜ ፡ ነውና ፤ መዝ ፡ ፲፭፥፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወበእንተዝ ፡ ተፈሥሐ ፡ ልብየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለዚህ ፡ እኔን ፡ ደስ ፡ አለኝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተሐሥየ ፡ ልሳንየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃሌን ፡ ወልድንም ፡ ደስ ፡ አለው ። አንድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ (ዘልፈ፡ እሬእዮ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር ፡ ቅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድሜየ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ በኵሉ ፡ ጊዜ) ፡ እግዚአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሔር ፡ ወልድ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ አብን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁልጊዜ ፡ በፊቴ ፡ በህልውናዬ ፡ አየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋለሁ ፡ አለ ። (እስመ ፡ በየማንየ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውእቱ ፡ ከመ ፡ ኢይትሀወክ ፤ እንዳይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለይ ፡ በቀኝ ፡ ነውና ፡ ምነው ፡ ወልድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይነብር ፡ በየማነ ፡ አብ ፡ ይላል ፡ እንጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አብ ፡ ይነብር ፡ በየማነ ፡ ወልድ ፡ ይላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልና ፡ እንዲህ ፡ አለ ፡ ቢሉ ፡ መቸስ ፡ ለሥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላሴ ፡ ቀኝ ፡ ግራ ፡ አላቸውን ፡ በክብር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲል፡(ጥቅ)፡እስመ፡ነቢር፡በዕሪና፡ያኤምር፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀበ ፡ ተዋሕዶቶሙ ፡ በክብር ፡ እንዲል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ወበእንተዝ ፡ ተፈሥሐ፡ ልብየ)፤ ስለዚህ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልቤን ፡ አብን ፡ ደስ ፡ አለው ፤ ወተሐ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥየ ፡ ልሳንየ ፤ እኔንም ፡ ደስ ፡ አለኝ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": "፳፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፯ ፤ ወዓዲ ፡ በተስፋሁ ፡ ኅደረ ፡ ሥጋየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳግመኛም፡ ያስነሣኛል፡ በማለት፡ ተስፋ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰውነቴ ፡ ጸና ፡(ጥቅ)፡መኑ ፡ ዘአስተኀደረ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማዕዘኒሃ፡ ለምድር፡ እንዲል።አንድም፡ ያስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሣኛል ፡ በማለት ፡ ተስፋ ፡ ሥጋዬ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሦስት ፡ መዓልት ፡ ሦስት ፡ ሌሊት ፡ በከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርሠ ፡ መቃብር ፡ አደረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኢተኀድጋ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ሲኦል ፡ ለነፍስየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነፍሴን ፡ በሲኦል ፡ አትተዋትምና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢትሁቦ ፡ ለጻድቅከ ፡ ይርአይ ፡ ሙስና ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢትሁቦ ፡ ጻድቅከ ፡ ይርአይ ፡ ጻድቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልጅህ ፡ ሙስና ፡ መቃብርን ፡ ያይ ፡ ዘንድ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢትሁቦ ፡ ለጻድቅከ ፡ ጻድቅ ፡ ልጅህን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለሙስና ፡ መቃብር ፡ አሳልፈህ ፡ አትሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጠውም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": "፳፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፰ ፤ ወመራኅከኒ ፡ ፍኖተ ፡ ሕይወት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አይሁድ ፡ ፍኖተ ፡ ሞትን ፡ ቢመሩኝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንተ ፡ ፍኖተ ፡ ትንሣኤን ፡ መራኸኝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአጽገብከኒ ፡ ሐሤተ ፡ ምስለ ፡ ገጽከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከነቢር ፡ በየማን ፡ ጋራ ፡ ትንሣኤን ፡ ዕር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገትን ፡ ሰጥተኸኝ ። አንድም ፡ ከባለሟ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልነት ፡ ጋራ ፡ በፍጹም ፡ ደስታ ፡ ደስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሰኘኸኝ ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ እስመ ፡ አልበስከኒ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
